{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1534826-camazotz-flying-and-guns","id":1534826,"title":"Camazotz flying and guns","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-27T18:22:37-07:00","id":1534826,"title":"Camazotz flying and guns","content":"Got a rules question (I don't care about the fluff).<br /> <br /> Can a Camazotz use a gun while flying?<br /> <br /> <img title=\"image.png\" data-tempid=\"temp_1539_1714267019589_576\" width=\"358\" height=\"428\" data-align=\"none\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1539\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1539\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1539&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> Here is their forms from CB20.<br /> <br /> I am going to be ST'ing for a player who is playing a werebat (I allowed) and he wants to be a sniper.<br /> He is stating that per the description of the crinos form, it would allow him to use his rifle while flying.<br /> <br /> My thoughts that if they are flying kinda like flying squirrels, then the need to keep your arms out wide to fly (And flap) would make firing a rilfe (Or even a handgun) impossible. <br /> <br /> Thoughts? Looking for hard rules both either for or against. I know i could just say no, but i'd like some sources to cite so I don't just sound like a dick.<br /> I know there isnt much on werebats but maybe Corax examples?<br /> <br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25261-solarknight","name":"SolarKnight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T18:44:46-07:00","id":1534827,"title":"","content":"This is one of those things where you won't find hard rules. Camatotz are not even supposed to exist in the average game. Both them and the corax need to use their arms to fly and I don't see using guns would be very sensible. Maybe a bow with their feet, but guns... ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T23:00:55-07:00","id":1534849,"title":"","content":"In Hungary we had some of those gun wielding mexican bats...<br /> (From <b>Macskafog\u00f3 - Cat City </b>(1986) )<br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> <img width=\"1480\" height=\"1080\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://dp8ij3ml0f16h.cloudfront.net/s3_files/styles/scaled_only_w_1920px_/s3/film/kep/macskafogo_78.jpg.webp?itok=6zilitfj\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://dp8ij3ml0f16h.cloudfront.net/s3_files/styles/scaled_only_w_1920px_/s3/film/kep/macskafogo_78.jpg.webp?itok=6zilitfj\" data-thumb-url=\"https://dp8ij3ml0f16h.cloudfront.net/s3_files/styles/scaled_only_w_1920px_/s3/film/kep/macskafogo_78.jpg.webp?itok=6zilitfj\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T01:05:28-07:00","id":1534850,"title":"","content":"A bat-hybrid might conceivably find it rather difficult to concentrate on doing this, as a bat in flight experiences a massive, jackhammering heart rate increase to just a few dozen beats below 1000 bpm and has a body temperature of around 108 F (41 C). Getting airborne without a pneumatized skeletal structure or unidirectional breathing, as it turns out, is hella hard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T12:51:47-07:00","id":1534856,"title":"","content":"Yeah.....thats not going to work.....but flying up to altitude then setting up as a sniper in Homid totally doable......its almost a traditional role for Corax so no reason a Camazotz couldn't also do so. . ( Fetish Bag to hold rifle)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T13:22:39-07:00","id":1534857,"title":"","content":"So, RAW, yes, no flying and gunning with your feet.<br /> <br /> That said, I don't think it would be out of character or out of place in the game for the Camazotz to have a &quot;feet as hands&quot; set of Gifts to be their counterpart to the Corax metal-wing attack set. Flying and shooting would probably still be not super effective in a stand up fight, but more of a surprise way to get in an attack from an unexpected angle or lay down ranged attacks to keep people from chasing as you're flying off (which works even if it was first used with bows instead of guns)..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T19:13:57-07:00","id":1534871,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'd rule that they couldn't do this as a base, but I'd allow a Rank 2ish or 3ish Gift to let them do that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}